5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure we make a decision based on operational reality rather than optimistic projections, I would like to examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm ready to do this. I want to see where the time is actually being wasted, so I'll look into the journey audits on where minutes go and the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent start, Asuka and Takumi. To ensure our ambitions are not merely fantasies of the ledger, I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to be in your company. To ensure we do not repeat the ghosts of our past, I shall examine the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. To understand the hidden complexities of our network, I shall examine the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have a comprehensive set of data points. By covering the financial, historical, and operational aspects, we can avoid the pitfalls of a one-dimensional analysis. I am satisfied with these selections.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I agree! We've got all the bases covered. I just want to make sure we don't get distracted by loud complaints and actually find out where the real delays are. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Takumi. The clamor of the crowd is often a poor substitute for the silence of the data. I believe our current distribution of research is quite elegant; it leaves very little to chance.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom teaches us that the present is but a reflection of the past. By blending your focus on the immediate with my look at our history, we shall find a path of true stability.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. There is a certain peace in knowing we have looked at the network from so many different angles. I look forward to seeing what the records reveal to us all.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have all agreed on our respective areas of investigation and the division of labor is clear, I believe further deliberation in this round is unnecessary. I am ready to review the findings.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready too! Let's see if the numbers actually match what people are complaining about. I can't wait to find out the truth!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite. Since we have reached a consensus with such remarkable efficiency, I shall also declare myself ready. Let us see if the financial records are as cooperative as our conversation has been.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I am also ready. Let us move forward with a spirit of openness and curiosity. I look forward to seeing how the lessons of yesterday can illuminate the choices of tomorrow.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I concur. I am ready to step into the silence of the archives and see what truths they hold for us. Until we reconvene, I wish you all a productive search.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
